{"at":"2026-11-23T16:46:32.039Z","round":3,"event":"write","id":"unlock_focus_after_buttons","ok":true,"cost_usd":0.5017053,"turns":10,"summary":"I fixed the focus ring on both unlock cards (new Scrapbook page and new friend). It now appears only after \"Keep going\" / \"Next →\" has faded in, not a second early. I couldn't run `npm run boot-test` because the command needs approval this session can't give, so the change is untested.\n\nIn `src/scenes/OutcomeScene.js`, each card now starts with `unlockCard.ready = false`. While it's false, `activeButtons()` returns no buttons, so no ring is drawn and Enter and the arrow keys do nothing on the card. When the buttons finish fading in, the `onComplete` sets `ready` and draws the ring. The fade-in now starts after the card is set up, because with Animations off it finishes at once. A click on the card or Esc still moves on as before.\n\nI also added a bullet for this feature to the \"Decisions taken in the prototype\" list in `CLAUDE.md`. Those two are the only files changed."}
